        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>模型 63 多个函数的综合问题（1）</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f7efe0;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f7efe0;\n    padding: 40px 45px 20px 45px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 18px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  .section-label {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 14px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  table.model {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  table.model td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .col-label {\n    width: 68px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .center {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .graph-cell {\n    height: 100px;\n    padding: 4px !important;\n  }\n  .graph-ph {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 92px;\n  }\n  .prop-cell {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n  .prop-cell p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 1.1em;\n  }\n  .example {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .example .lead {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .small-caps {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n  }\n  .grid-ph {\n    width: 175px;\n    height: 105px;\n    margin: 12px auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .options {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n  }\n  .options span {\n    font-style: normal;\n  }\n  .options .lbl {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">模型 63&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;多个函数的综合问题（1）</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"section-label\">【模型分析】</div>\n\n  <table class=\"model\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col-label\">反比例函数</td>\n      <td class=\"center\" colspan=\"2\">$y=\\dfrac{k}{x}$&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"small-caps\">($k\\neq 0$)</span></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col-label\"><em>k</em> 的符号</td>\n      <td class=\"center\"><em>k</em>&gt;0</td>\n      <td class=\"center\"><em>k</em>&lt;0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col-label\">图像</td>\n      <td class=\"graph-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder graph-ph\">[Diagram: 双曲线位于第一、三象限的坐标图像，坐标轴标注 y、x、O]</div></td>\n      <td class=\"graph-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder graph-ph\">[Diagram: 双曲线位于第二、四象限的坐标图像，坐标轴标注 y、x、O]</div></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"col-label\">性质</td>\n      <td class=\"prop-cell\">\n        <p>①<em>x</em> 的取值范围是 <em>x</em>≠0，<em>y</em></p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">的取值范围是 <em>y</em>≠0</p>\n        <p>②当 <em>k</em>&gt;0 时，函数图像两个分</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">支分布在一、三象限，在每个</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">象限内，<em>y</em> 随着 <em>x</em> 增大而减小</p>\n      </td>\n      <td class=\"prop-cell\">\n        <p>①<em>x</em> 的取值范围是 <em>x</em>≠0，<em>y</em></p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">的取值范围是 <em>y</em>≠0</p>\n        <p>②当 <em>k</em>&lt;0 时，函数图像两个分</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">支分布在二、四象限，在每个</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">象限内，<em>y</em> 随着 <em>x</em> 增大而增大</p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"section-label\">【经典例题】</div>\n\n  <div class=\"example\">\n    <span class=\"lead\">例 1．（2020·浙江九年级一模）</span>已知下列四个函数：① $y=2x$；② $y=-\\dfrac{2}{3}x+4$；③ $y=\\dfrac{4}{x}$；<br>\n    ④ $y=-\\left(x-\\dfrac{8}{3}\\right)^{2}+\\dfrac{31}{9}$．其中图象经过如图所示阴影部分（包括边界）的函数有（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder grid-ph\">[Diagram: centered — 平面直角坐标系网格图，纵轴 y 标注 1~4，横轴 x 标注 1~4，原点 O，图中含阴影三角形区域]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div><span class=\"lbl\">A．</span>①②</div>\n    <div><span class=\"lbl\">B．</span>①③</div>\n    <div><span class=\"lbl\">C．</span>②③</div>\n    <div><span class=\"lbl\">D．</span>②③④</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-num\">36</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
